2:7	compose:parameter-naming	manual	Lambda parameters in a composable function should be in present tense, not past tense.\nExamples: `onClick` and not `onClicked`, `onTextChange` and not `onTextChanged`, etc.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#naming-parameters-properly for more information.
